# Test_Files holds working copies -- corpora being built into future samples --
# plus the one fixture the test suite opens. The n70 .FCStd and the 5.3 MB
# deep-nest .dxf are among the working copies and were named individually
# before; a directory rule is less work than extending that list each time.
tests/Test_Files/*
